  <data key="d1">ATF4</data>
  <data key="d2">ATF4</data>
  <data key="d3">protein</data>
  <data key="d4">mtorc1_output_autophagy_metabolism_feedback</data>
  <data key="d5">6</data>
  <data key="d6">Integrated-stress-response transcription factor translated when eIF2alpha is phosphorylated; induces DDIT4 (REDD1) and SESN2, inhibiting mTORC1 under ER stress, energy stress and amino-acid starvation. Also an mTORC1 output.</data>
