  <data key="d8">IL-1a; interleukin-1 alpha</data>
</node>
<node id="LDHA">
  <data key="d1">LDHA</data>
  <data key="d2">LDHA</data>
  <data key="d3">protein</data>
  <data key="d4">mtorc1_output_autophagy_metabolism_feedback</data>
  <data key="d5">6</data>
  <data key="d6">Lactate dehydrogenase A, induced by HIF-1alpha; regenerates NAD+ by converting pyruvate to lactate and sustains aerobic glycolysis.</data>
