  <data key="d11">other</data>
  <data key="d12">inhibits</data>
  <data key="d13">Eccentric contractions increase TSC2 RxRxxS/T-motif phosphorylation and move TSC2 away from the lysosome while mTOR associates with it; responsible kinase not defined.</data>
