  <data key="d17">skeletal muscle</data>
  <data key="d18">upstream_of_mTORC1</data>
  <data key="d19">The mechanistic link between mechanical load and TSC2 relocalisation rests on a single laboratory; phosphatidic acid/PLD and focal-adhesion routes are the alternatives [241,683].</data>
