  <data key="d16">149; 241; 683</data>
  <data key="d17">skeletal muscle; resistance exercise</data>
  <data key="d18">upstream_of_mTORC1</data>
  <data key="d19">The net activation of mTORC1 by loading is reproducible while the proximal lipid step is unsettled; opposite in sign to the endurance-exercise input to AMPK, so exercise modality determines the net effect.</data>
