  <data key="d12">activates</data>
  <data key="d13">H2O2/mitochondrial ROS increase AMPK Thr172 phosphorylation; proposed direct oxidation of AMPK alpha Cys299/Cys304 versus indirect activation through ATP depletion and AMP/ADP rise.</data>
