  <data key="d13">Autosomal recessive STRADA loss causes polyhydramnios, megalencephaly and symptomatic (intractable) epilepsy through impaired LKB1-AMPK signalling and mTORC1 hyperactivation; rapamycin reduces seizures.</data>
