  <data key="d12">inhibits</data>
  <data key="d13">Biallelic STRADA loss removes the pseudokinase subunit required for LKB1 activity and cytoplasmic localisation, so the LKB1–STRADα–MO25 heterotrimer cannot assemble and LKB1–AMPK signalling is impaired.</data>
