  <data key="d11">other</data>
  <data key="d12">activates</data>
  <data key="d13">Loss of LKB1-AMPK restraint in STRADA-null neurons produces constitutive mTORC1 hyperactivity, the shared mechanism of the mTORopathies; rapamycin rescues aberrant cortical lamination and heterotopia in STRADA-depleted preclinical models, and the human experience is a small open-label series reporting reduced seizure frequency.</data>
