  <data key="d12">activates</data>
  <data key="d13">Germline heterozygous DEPDC5 loss of function disinhibits RagA/B and produces mTORC1 hyperactivity in the cortical lesion, causing familial focal epilepsy with variable foci and elevated risk of sudden unexpected death in epilepsy.</data>
