  <data key="d12">modulates</data>
  <data key="d13">Activating FAT- and kinase-domain MTOR variants raise kinase activity two- to ten-fold and were present in exceptional responders, including concurrent E2014K and E2419K in a urothelial complete responder treated with everolimus and pazopanib.</data>
