  <data key="d11">genetic_loss_of_function</data>
  <data key="d12">inhibits</data>
  <data key="d13">Germline (Peutz-Jeghers) or somatic STK11 inactivation abolishes AMPK Thr172 phosphorylation under energy stress; the TSC2/Raptor checkpoints fail and mTORC1 is deregulated in LKB1-null cells and tumours.</data>
  <data key="d14">established</data>
  <data key="d15"></data>
  <data key="d16">138; 231; 551</data>
  <data key="d17">Peutz-Jeghers syndrome; lung adenocarcinoma</data>
  <data key="d18">pathophysiological</data>
