  <data key="d11">genetic_loss_of_function</data>
  <data key="d12">activates</data>
  <data key="d13">Whole-genome sequencing of a durable complete responder to everolimus identified a loss-of-function TSC1 mutation; TSC1 mutations were then found in approximately 8% of a further 109 bladder cancers and correlated with everolimus sensitivity and time on treatment.</data>
  <data key="d14">emerging</data>
