  <data key="d12">activates</data>
  <data key="d13">TSC1 loss destabilises the TSC complex and abolishes TSC2 GAP activity toward Rheb, so Rheb-GTP accumulates and mTORC1 is constitutively activated.</data>
  <data key="d14">established</data>
  <data key="d15"></data>
