  <data key="d10">FKBP12</data>
  <data key="d11">binding</data>
  <data key="d12">required_for</data>
  <data key="d13">The rapamycin end of the bi-steric molecule recruits FKBP12; the resulting avidity for the FRB-bearing complex is what confers mTORC1 selectivity on an otherwise non-selective ATP-site warhead.</data>
  <data key="d14">established</data>
  <data key="d15"></data>
