  <data key="d11">binding</data>
  <data key="d12">required_for</data>
  <data key="d13">Rapamycin binds the FKBP12 immunophilin with low-nanomolar affinity; the binary complex, not free drug, is the inhibitory species, so FKBP12 is obligatory for all rapalog action.</data>
  <data key="d14">established</data>
