  <data key="d11">drug_inhibition</data>
  <data key="d12">modulates</data>
  <data key="d13">Intermittent dosing allows mTORC2 to recover between doses; preclinical data and low-exposure human cohorts without dysglycaemia support this but no powered trial has tested it.</data>
