  <data key="d11">drug_inhibition</data>
  <data key="d12">activates</data>
  <data key="d13">High-dose rapamycin precipitated delayed sleep–wake phase disorder in some Smith–Kingsmore patients, whereas low doses improved sleep: dose and timing interact with sleep architecture.</data>
