  <data key="d10">DISEASE_AD</data>
  <data key="d11">drug_inhibition</data>
  <data key="d12">inhibits</data>
  <data key="d13">Rapamycin reduces brain amyloid-beta and improves cognition in 3xTg-AD mice, with benefit dependent on intact autophagy and largely confined to treatment initiated before substantial pathology accumulates.</data>
