  <data key="d11">drug_inhibition</data>
  <data key="d12">activates</data>
  <data key="d13">In kidney transplant recipients without pre-existing diabetes sirolimus was independently associated with new-onset diabetes, adjusted hazard ratios roughly 1.4-1.7.</data>
