  <data key="d10">DISEASE_NODAT</data>
  <data key="d11">physiological_output</data>
  <data key="d12">activates</data>
  <data key="d13">In kidney transplant recipients without pre-existing diabetes, sirolimus was independently associated with new-onset diabetes across regimens, with adjusted hazard ratios of roughly 1.4-1.7.</data>
