  <data key="d11">drug_inhibition</data>
  <data key="d12">activates</data>
  <data key="d13">Hypertriglyceridaemia and hypercholesterolaemia on mTOR inhibitors reflect altered hepatic and adipose lipid handling, with both complexes implicated.</data>
