  <data key="d10">PHENO_LEAN_MASS</data>
  <data key="d11">drug_inhibition</data>
  <data key="d12">modulates</data>
  <data key="d13">In PEARL, lean tissue mass increased rather than decreased in women on 10 mg weekly compounded rapamycin; a secondary, sex-restricted finding at very low exposure.</data>
  <data key="d14">emerging</data>
