  <data key="d13">Temsirolimus binds FKBP12 and the binary complex engages the exposed FRB domain of assembled mTORC1, sterically restricting substrate access; it is given intravenously as an ester prodrug converted to sirolimus, which contributes much of the effect in vivo.</data>
