  <data key="d9">SESN3</data>
  <data key="d10">GATOR2</data>
  <data key="d11">sequestration</data>
  <data key="d12">inhibits</data>
  <data key="d13">Sestrin3 also binds GATOR2 and negatively regulates the amino-acid sensing pathway upstream of mTORC1</data>
