<edge source="AR" target="MTORC1" id="other:5952f4d6c156f14d">
  <data key="d9">AR</data>
  <data key="d10">MTORC1</data>
  <data key="d11">other</data>
  <data key="d12">activates</data>
  <data key="d13">Androgen/AR signalling raises mTORC1 activity and cyclin D translation in prostate cancer cells; AR and PI3K–AKT are reciprocally cross-inhibitory in PTEN-null prostate cancer.</data>
