  <data key="d12">activates</data>
  <data key="d13">Indirect. EGFR carries no high-affinity p85-binding motif of its own, so EGF-stimulated PI3K and AKT signalling is relayed through the docking protein GAB1 and, in EGFR-ERBB3 heterodimers, through the pYXXM motifs of ERBB3.</data>
