<edge source="IRS1" target="SREBF1" id="other:021b4441faea762d">
  <data key="d9">IRS1</data>
  <data key="d10">SREBF1</data>
  <data key="d11">other</data>
  <data key="d12">activates</data>
  <data key="d13">Indirect effect: insulin signalling through IRS-1, PI3K and AKT is a required positive input to hepatic SREBP1c expression and processing. In liver-specific Tsc1-deficient mice, S6K1-mediated inhibitory phosphorylation of IRS-1 suppresses this input and SREBP1c, protecting against diet-induced steatosis despite constitutive mTORC1 activity.</data>
  <data key="d14">established</data>
