  <data key="d12">activates</data>
  <data key="d13">FBP-unoccupied aldolase alters v-ATPase-Ragulator conformation, permitting AXIN-LKB1 docking and lysosomal AMPK Thr172 phosphorylation without an AMP rise; FBP-bound aldolase blocks the assembly.</data>
