  <data key="d17">glucose starvation</data>
  <data key="d18">upstream_of_mTORC1</data>
  <data key="d19">The sensed ligand is fructose-1,6-bisphosphate; the signal starts when it dissociates from aldolase as glucose falls. Reported mainly by one laboratory, which later showed that TRPV channels relay the aldolase signal (Li et al. 2019).</data>
  <data key="d20">energy_stress_input</data>
  <data key="d21">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="AXIN1" target="AMPK" id="scaffolding:ccb6e95a0c79bc8c">
