  <data key="d12">activates</data>
  <data key="d13">AMP binding to the AMPK gamma subunit drives AXIN to tether LKB1 to AMPK, and under glucose starvation the AXIN-LKB1-AMPK complex docks on the lysosomal v-ATPase-Ragulator, allowing LKB1 to phosphorylate AMPK Thr172.</data>
