  <data key="d12">activates</data>
  <data key="d13">Under low energy, AMP-bound AMPK, AXIN and LKB1 assemble into a complex in which AXIN tethers LKB1 to AMPK, enhancing Thr172 phosphorylation; AXIN knockdown in mouse liver impairs AMPK activation after starvation.</data>
