  <data key="d12">inhibits</data>
  <data key="d13">In normoxia PHD2 hydroxylates HIF-1α at Pro402 and Pro564 using O2 as co-substrate, creating the pVHL-binding degron; the reaction rate is limited by oxygen tension, which is what makes HIF-1α an oxygen sensor.</data>
