  <data key="d11">phosphorylation</data>
  <data key="d12">activates</data>
  <data key="d13">The constitutively active LKB1–STRADα–MO25 heterotrimer is the upstream kinase that phosphorylates the AMPK activation loop at Thr172; STRADα and MO25 are required for LKB1 catalytic competence and cytoplasmic localisation.</data>
  <data key="d14">established</data>
