  <data key="d12">modulates</data>
  <data key="d13">PEX5, the peroxisomal targeting-signal receptor, binds TSC2 and localises a pool of the TSC complex to the peroxisome, where it suppresses Rheb in response to reactive oxygen species; TSC1 is recognised by the partner receptor PEX19.</data>
  <data key="d14">emerging</data>
