  <data key="d13">LKB1 (with STRADA/MO25) phosphorylates the AMPK alpha activation-loop Thr172; AMP bound to the gamma subunit makes AMPK a better substrate and protects pThr172, so net phosphorylation rises with AMP/ATP.</data>
