  <data key="d13">The pseudokinase STRAD-alpha binds the LKB1 kinase domain and, together with MO25, stabilises the catalytically active conformation and anchors LKB1 in the cytoplasm where AMPK is phosphorylated; STRAD-alpha alone gives only partial activation.</data>
