  <data key="d9">PPIA</data>
  <data key="d10">PPP3</data>
  <data key="d11">binding</data>
  <data key="d12">inhibits</data>
  <data key="d13">The cyclosporine-cyclophilin A complex binds and inhibits calcineurin, converging on the same target as the tacrolimus-FKBP12 complex; neither free immunophilin inhibits the phosphatase.</data>
