  <data key="d9">ARF1</data>
  <data key="d10">MTORC1</data>
  <data key="d11">other</data>
  <data key="d12">activates</data>
  <data key="d13">Arf1 is required for glutamine-induced mTORC1 activation and lysosomal translocation by a route that does not require the Rag GTPases</data>
