  <data key="d10">AXIN1</data>
  <data key="d11">recruitment</data>
  <data key="d12">activates</data>
  <data key="d13">Under glucose starvation v-ATPase-Ragulator recruits AXIN-LKB1 to the lysosomal surface next to lysosomal AMPK; AXIN simultaneously blocks Ragulator GEF activity toward RagA/B, releasing mTORC1 from the lysosome.</data>
