  <data key="d9">RUVBL1</data>
  <data key="d10">MTORC1</data>
  <data key="d11">scaffolding</data>
  <data key="d12">required_for</data>
  <data key="d13">Energy-replete conditions drive TTT-RUVBL1/2 assembly, which promotes mTORC1 dimerisation and lysosomal localisation; energy stress dissociates the module and the dimer, coupling nutrient state to the oligomeric state of the complex.</data>
