  <data key="d11">genetic_loss_of_function</data>
  <data key="d12">inhibits</data>
  <data key="d13">FLCN loss removes the GAP for RagC/D; mTORC1 signalling is consequently dysregulated in a tissue-dependent rather than uniformly increased manner.</data>
