  <data key="d11">stabilisation</data>
  <data key="d12">activates</data>
  <data key="d13">TBC1D7 binding to the TSC1 coiled-coil stabilises the TSC1-TSC2 association that presents the Rheb-GAP domain; its depletion weakens that association and reduces Rheb-GAP activity, raising mTORC1 signalling, without lowering TSC2 levels or altering TSC2 localisation to the lysosome.</data>
