  <data key="d11">complex_formation</data>
  <data key="d12">component_of</data>
  <data key="d13">Two TSC1 (hamartin) copies form the coiled-coil scaffold of the 2:2:1 arch-shaped TSC1–TSC2–TBC1D7 complex.</data>
