  <data key="d16">399</data>
  <data key="d17">normoxia</data>
  <data key="d18">upstream_of_mTORC1</data>
  <data key="d19">The normoxic degradation arm, relieved by hypoxia and by inhibition of the prolyl hydroxylases; VHL loss in clear-cell renal carcinoma produces constitutive HIF signalling.</data>
  <data key="d20">energy_stress_input</data>
  <data key="d21">-1</data>
</edge>
