  <data key="d10">TTI1</data>
  <data key="d11">binding</data>
  <data key="d12">required_for</data>
  <data key="d13">Tel2 binds Tti1 (and Tti2) to form the TTT module; loss of any subunit destabilises the others and lowers the steady-state level of all PIKKs including mTOR.</data>
