  <data key="d11">scaffolding</data>
  <data key="d12">required_for</data>
  <data key="d13">mSin1 CRIM-dependent recruitment of AGC kinases extends to protein kinase C isoforms; mTORC2 substrate preference among AGC kinases is modulated by subtle Rictor-mSin1 interface changes.</data>
