  <data key="d13">The central CRIM domain of mSin1 recruits AGC-kinase substrates generally, not AKT alone; Sin1-dependent recruitment is required for mTORC2 to phosphorylate SGK1, and different AGC kinases are differentially sensitive to perturbation of mSin1.</data>
