  <data key="d11">physiological_output</data>
  <data key="d12">inhibits</data>
  <data key="d13">Deletion of mTOR in the adult mouse myocardium causes a fatal dilated cardiomyopathy with cardiomyocyte apoptosis and accumulation of 4E-BP1, marking the lower bound of the cardiac therapeutic window for mTOR inhibition.</data>
  <data key="d14">established</data>
