  <data key="d19">mTORC1 phosphorylates at least 26 rapamycin-sensitive serine and threonine residues on LARP1, arranged in seven clusters. The cluster next to the DM15 region is the most rapamycin-sensitive.</data>
  <data key="d20">mtorc1_output_translation_ribosome</data>
