  <data key="d16">122</data>
  <data key="d17">glutamine metabolism and SIRT4 repression in proliferating cells</data>
  <data key="d18">downstream_of_mTORC1</data>
  <data key="d19">This is opposite in sign to the mTORC1-dependent translational induction of ATF4 reproduced in several laboratories for purine, one-carbon and glutathione synthesis; the degradation arm rests on a single study and the conditions that reconcile the two are unknown.</data>
  <data key="d20">mtorc1_output_autophagy_metabolism_feedback</data>
