  <data key="d11">physiological_output</data>
  <data key="d12">inhibits</data>
  <data key="d13">Loss of hepatic mTORC2 disinhibits gluconeogenesis and reduces glucokinase-dependent glycolysis, producing glucose intolerance; this is the chief source of rapalog dysglycaemia.</data>
