  <data key="d11">genetic_loss_of_function</data>
  <data key="d12">inhibits</data>
  <data key="d13">Renal mTORC2 loss causes salt wasting and hypotension through failure of SGK1-dependent activation of ENaC, the Na+/K+-ATPase and CLC-K in the distal nephron.</data>
  <data key="d14">established</data>
  <data key="d15"></data>
  <data key="d16">329</data>
