  <data key="d13">Hepatic mTORC2 phosphorylates AKT at Ser473, and AKT-dependent glucokinase induction and SREBP1c processing drive lipogenesis; SREBP1 is therefore an indirect output of this complex, and the same transcription factor is driven by both complexes in liver.</data>
