  <data key="d11">other</data>
  <data key="d12">activates</data>
  <data key="d13">Conditional Rictor deletion in the postnatal forebrain lowers Tiam1 levels and Tiam1-dependent Rac1 activation; the step between the complex and Tiam1 is undefined.</data>
  <data key="d14">emerging</data>
  <data key="d15"></data>
  <data key="d16">250</data>
  <data key="d17">postnatal murine forebrain</data>
  <data key="d18">downstream_of_mTORC2</data>
  <data key="d19">Tiam1 is not a known substrate of the complex, and the relationship rests on a single line of work in one tissue.</data>
