  <data key="d10">TISSUE_LIVER</data>
  <data key="d11">physiological_output</data>
  <data key="d12">required_for</data>
  <data key="d13">Liver-specific Rictor deletion produces glucose intolerance and a phenotype reminiscent of type 2 diabetes, so hepatic mTORC2 is required for normal glucose handling.</data>
