  <data key="d10">TISSUE_OLIGODENDROCYTE</data>
  <data key="d11">physiological_output</data>
  <data key="d12">modulates</data>
  <data key="d13">mTORC2 contributes to oligodendrocyte differentiation but is not rate-limiting while mTORC1 is intact; the deficit becomes apparent only in the raptor/rictor double mutant.</data>
