  <data key="d12">inhibits</data>
  <data key="d13">In the basal state the mSin1 PH domain folds back onto the mTOR kinase domain and suppresses catalysis; this is the autoinhibited resting conformation of mTORC2.</data>
  <data key="d14">established</data>
