  <data key="d11">other</data>
  <data key="d12">inhibits</data>
  <data key="d13">Protor-2 acts within mTORC2 to restrain phosphorylation of PKC-delta by the complex; its degradation downstream of G-alpha-12 permits PKC-delta phosphorylation and promotes cell migration, with no evidence of direct binding to the kinase.</data>
