  <data key="d13">Rictor binds the mTOR N-HEAT solenoid and is required for mTORC2 assembly and integrity; with mSin1 it occludes the FRB domain and forms the N-terminal mooring that docks the AKT C-lobe, whereas the mSin1 CRIM domain provides the principal substrate-docking surface.</data>
