  <data key="d11">competitive_inhibition</data>
  <data key="d12">inhibits</data>
  <data key="d13">Rictor, with mSin1, occupies a surface on the mTOR N-HEAT solenoid that overlaps the Raptor footprint, so Raptor and Rictor binding to mTOR are mutually exclusive and the two complexes partition a common mTOR pool.</data>
  <data key="d14">established</data>
