  <data key="d12">required_for</data>
  <data key="d13">Raptor binds the C-terminal TOS motif of 4E-BP1 and, according to NMR data, the N-terminal RAIP motif at a separate site, tethering 4E-BP1 so that its phosphoacceptor region is presented to the mTOR active site.</data>
  <data key="d14">established</data>
