  <data key="d12">required_for</data>
  <data key="d13">RRN3/TIF-IA binds both Pol I and the TAF1B subunit of promoter-bound SL1/TIF-IB, bridging initiation-competent polymerase to the rDNA promoter. This bridging step is the point at which the mTORC1 input on TIF-IA Ser44 is converted into pre-initiation complex formation.</data>
