  <data key="d13">Binding to eIF4E protects hypophosphorylated 4E-BP1 from ubiquitination by the KLHL25-CUL3 ligase. When eIF4E is depleted, hypophosphorylated 4E-BP1 is degraded while hyperphosphorylated 4E-BP1 is spared, so 4E-BP1 levels track eIF4E abundance.</data>
